 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When facing the enemies and obstacles on daughter's path of growth, there is not just one way to resolve them. In addition to allowing daughter to cultivate herself and use her divine weapon to &quot;win people over with reason,&quot; she can also achieve a non-violent victory by learning the language of the demon race, making the enemy surrender without a fight, and so on... The unique and diverse outdoor explorations and multi-faceted battles make every journey daughter takes full of surprises and excitement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/5005c682eef16f1295129e5ba7cc631f.poster.avif?t=1740113446\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/5005c682eef16f1295129e5ba7cc631f.webm?t=1740113446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/5005c682eef16f1295129e5ba7cc631f.mp4?t=1740113446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/51267457787688bf9ab662710f0e87fc.poster.avif?t=1740113446\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/51267457787688bf9ab662710f0e87fc.webm?t=1740113446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/51267457787688bf9ab662710f0e87fc.mp4?t=1740113446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto